<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Support — Recruiter Lab</title></head><body><main><a class="back" href="/lucas-capability-os-pages/legal-recruiter-lab/">← Recruiter Lab</a><p class="kicker">SUPPORT</p><h1>Support</h1><p class="lead">For order, access, or product-description issues, start with the receipt or order page generated by the checkout provider.</p><section><h2>Order and billing</h2><p>Use the receipt, order page, or Lemon Squeezy support path shown in your purchase confirmation for billing, invoice, payment-method, or merchant-of-record questions.</p></section><section><h2>Product access</h2><p>If a live purchase is marked paid but the file is unavailable, keep the order number and purchase email available. Those details are enough to investigate delivery without sharing card information.</p></section><section><h2>Security</h2><p>Never send passwords, full card numbers, identity documents, API keys, or authentication codes in a support message. Recruiter Lab does not need them to investigate a digital-product order.</p></section><section><h2>Product questions</h2><p>Questions about the learning material should identify the chapter, exercise, or toolkit item involved. Do not send confidential client or candidate information.</p></section><p class="note">A dedicated brand support mailbox will be added before live launch. Until then, live sales remain disabled.</p><footer><a href="./privacy">Privacy</a><a href="./terms">Terms</a><a href="./refund">Refunds</a></footer><p class="flow">Flow note — This page establishes a safe support path before the dedicated Recruiter Lab support mailbox is activated.</p></main></body></html><style>:root{--ink:#111;--paper:#f5f3ed;--line:#cbc8bf;--muted:#69675f}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:42px 24px 70px}.back,footer a{color:inherit}.kicker{margin-top:70px;font:700 10px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:clamp(64px,12vw,120px);letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.85;margin:18px 0 36px}.lead{font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;max-width:720px}section{padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px}p{line-height:1.7}section p,.note{color:#55534d}.note{font-size:12px}footer{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #111;padding-top:24px;margin-top:40px;font-size:12px}.flow{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}</style>